     * state; the target's own contract does not promise the next call is legal.
     * Driving on regardless explores garbage state and produces harness-artifact
     * crashes — the same failure the constructor guard above exists to prevent,
     * one call later. Stop driving the handle and go straight to teardown, which
     * is still owed because construction succeeded. */
