     * one sets it. Ordinary ops run only while live, a close only while live,
     * and an open only while closed — so the sequence can cycle the object
     * (close then reopen, the shape leveldb's own fuzzer spells `kReopenDb`)
     * and re-init over live state, WITHOUT ever driving use-after-close.
